-- ============================================================================
-- Origin AA: move the rank spell below the RoF2 client's spell ceiling
--
-- Root cause of "Origin does nothing when pressed":
--   The RoF2 client allocates a fixed spell array of TOTAL_SPELL_COUNT = 0xAFC9
--   (45,001) entries (Release-NMS-Client/eqgame_dll/EQData.h) and its
--   GetSpellByID rejects any id >= 45001. aa_ranks 41000 pointed the Origin AA
--   at spell 121861, ~2.7x past that ceiling, so the client never had the
--   spell; the AA button produced nothing and the activation packet was never
--   sent. The server side was fine (spell loads in shared memory, rank owned,
--   SPA 322 -> Client::GoToBind(4)).
--
--   Same failure/fix as Greater Soul Gem, whose spells moved 50015/50016 ->
--   44011/44012.
--
-- Fix: clone the Origin spell to 44021 (next free id after the stock/custom
--   block ends at 44020) and repoint the rank. 121861 is removed.
--
-- After applying:
--   1. export-client-files.bat <EQ-client-folder>   (adds spell 44021)
--   2. shared-memory.bat                            (rebuilds shared/spells)
--   3. restart the zone layer, then relog the client.
--
-- Idempotent. Rollback: 20261016_origin_aa_spell_id_fix_rollback.sql
-- ============================================================================
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

-- 1) Origin spell: 121861 -> 44021
DELETE FROM `spells_new` WHERE `id` = 44021;
